I read [here](https://davidwalsh.name/browser-camera) that I could access the camera from the browser, so I decided to build a small image-processing demo. One of the simplest projects is color clustering. This pixel classification creates a nice cartoonish effect.

The algorithms implemented here are [K-means][kmeans] and a simplified [Gaussian mixture model][gaussian].

Check the cool demo below!

![Video of the clustering colors demo](/posts/ClusteringColors/ClusteringColors.webm)

